# 5.0.0b hotfix
You may be thinking "Another hotfix? What happened?" and this time is way worse than other hotfixes, Macrodroid corrupted the macro, i didn't notice, and uploaded it anyways, by the time i notice the macro was uploaded for a few days and i had a LOT to fix, since this corruption affected magic text.
So here is the hotfix to fix that, based on the last stable testing version and with (i think) all the changes of the actual 5.0 and 5.0.0a, if you notice something missing please let me know.
So, the changelog:
- Fixed a LOT of bugs
